<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Takushoku aims to write off loans by 2000.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Takushoku aims to write off loans by 2000.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd hopes to finish its bad loan write offs by the end of March 2000, a senior bank official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
